  "goodToKnow": "Alljährlich means annual or every year, with a sense of tradition: das alljährliche Sommerfest, die alljährliche Steuererklärung. Similar: allwöchentlich, allabendlich (every evening), alltäglich (everyday, also ordinary). The plain word jährlich is more neutral. Jahrelang means for years. Germany's biggest alljährliche festival, the Oktoberfest, starts in September and draws about six million visitors."
